  ". Product images and linked third-party material retain their separate rights and provenance.": "许可。产品图片和链接的第三方资料保留各自权利与来源记录。",
  "The main list combines complete bikes and frameset-based builds where total cost can be compared honestly. Products are identified by exact category, model, generation, and configuration.": "主目录在能够合理比较总成本时，同时展示整车与车架装车方案。产品按具体类别、型号、代际与配置识别。",
  "Each published frameset receives the selected total build allowance, with": "每个已发布车架组都会加上所选的装车预算；已复核的默认值为",
  "retained as the reviewed default. The compact homepage selector is a quick planning estimate, not a shopping cart or guaranteed package price.": "。首页的简洁选择器用于快速规划，不是购物车，也不是保证成交的套餐报价。",
  "The separate": "独立的",
  "Build page": "装车页面",
  "selects a frameset and every required component slot. A package is counted once, and any explicitly included brake or drivetrain parts suppress duplicate rows. Price and weight remain known subtotals while one or more exact inputs are missing. Compatibility warnings cover only recorded standards and never replace seller or mechanic confirmation.": "用于选择车架组和必需部件。套餐只计算一次，明确包含的刹车或传动部件不会重复计入。只要具体输入仍有缺失，价格和重量就只是已知小计。兼容性提示仅覆盖已记录标准，不能取代卖家或技师确认。",
  "The visible price is the complete-bike price or the estimated complete-build price. The info button contains the underlying frame or included-package price, observation date, freshness, record status, conditions, and great-buy reference.": "显示价格为整车价格或估算装车价格。信息按钮可查看基础车架或套餐价格、观察日期、时效、记录状态、条件及购价参考。",
  "Gravel products expose tire clearance when the evidence supports it. MTB products use suspension travel, e-road products use motor and battery facts, folding products use fold or wheel data, and triathlon products use time-trial fit and storage facts. Unverified fields stay visibly unknown.": "有证据时，Gravel 车型展示轮胎空间；山地车展示避震行程，电助力公路车展示电机与电池，折叠车展示折叠或轮径信息，铁三车展示计时骑姿和储物信息。未核实字段继续明确标为未知。",
  "Selected model videos help buyers see a platform and hear build or ride context. They are secondary editorial material, not authority for a current price, exact BOM, specification, or recommendation. Commercial and product-supply relationships are labelled.": "精选车型视频帮助读者了解外观、装车或骑行背景。它们属于补充编辑资料，不能单独证明当前价格、完整配件清单、规格或推荐结论；商业及产品提供关系会注明。",
  "For carbon products, fiber labels such as T700, T800, or T1000 are not quality scores. Lay-up, compaction, curing, alignment, testing, traceability, and support matter more. Missing evidence increases uncertainty; it does not automatically mean a product is poor.": "对碳纤维产品而言，T700、T800、T1000 等纤维标签不是质量评分。铺层、压实、固化、对齐、测试、可追溯性与售后更重要。缺少证据会增加不确定性，不代表产品一定差。",
  "Each change should identify the exact model or generation and include a source.": "每次更改应明确具体型号或代际，并附来源。",
  "The site has no account, analytics, advertising tracker, newsletter, payment system, or backend. Bike comparisons, the optional frameset allowance and the Build-page configuration are stored only in the visitor’s browser and may also be encoded in the URL when a visitor chooses or copies a build.": "本站没有账号、流量分析、广告追踪、订阅邮件、支付系统或后端。车型对比、可选装车预算和装车页配置仅保存在访问者的浏览器中；选择或复制配置时，也可能编码在网址中。",
  "Some product photos load from their credited manufacturer or retailer, which receives a normal image request. Selected XHS and marketplace evidence images may load from the project’s separate media origin or from the same GitHub Pages site as small sanitized WebP derivatives. Public source links are reduced to identity-safe canonical post or listing URLs. Remote images use": "部分产品图片从已署名的厂家或零售商加载，对方会收到常规图片请求。精选小红书及市场证据图片可能从项目的独立媒体域名加载，也可能以经隐私处理的小尺寸 WebP 文件从本站加载。公开来源链接仅保留不会暴露个人身份的标准帖子或商品地址。远程图片使用",
  "; when a source fails, the image is hidden and the product facts remain available.": "；来源失效时隐藏图片，产品事实仍可查看。",
  "GitHub issues and pull requests are public. Remove names, account details, addresses, order IDs, payment information, faces, license plates, location metadata, and share or referral parameters before submitting screenshots, photos, or source links. A removal request may identify the model and canonical source URL without publishing private contact details.": "GitHub 问题与合并请求是公开的。提交截图、照片或来源链接前，请删除姓名、账号信息、地址、订单号、支付信息、人脸、车牌、位置元数据及分享或推荐参数。申请移除内容时，可提供车型和标准来源网址，不要公开私人联系方式。",
  "Manufacturer images are preferred. Selected XHS, Taobao, and Xianyu images may be shown when they identify an exact bicycle or expose useful geometry, size, clearance, weight, package, compatibility, or aero information. They normally stay remote; a small optimized WebP derivative may be stored with the site when a stable remote display is unavailable. Copyright remains with the original owner and the source stays visibly linked.": "优先使用厂家图片。精选小红书、淘宝和闲鱼图片可用于识别具体车型，或提供几何、尺码、轮胎空间、重量、套餐、兼容性及气动造型信息。通常保留远程引用；无法稳定显示时，可在本站保存小尺寸优化 WebP 衍生文件。版权归原权利人，来源链接始终可见。",
  "Every community or marketplace image needs an identity-safe canonical source URL, owner or seller credit, exact-model mapping, alt text, content hashes, and a completed privacy review. Share, referral, invite, tracking, session, and account parameters are removed. Images are stripped of metadata and visible personal identifiers before hosting.": "每张社区或市场图片都需具备不暴露身份的标准来源地址、作者或卖家署名、具体车型对应关系、替代文字、内容哈希及完成的隐私检查。分享、推荐、邀请、追踪、会话及账号参数会删除；托管前移除图片元数据和可见个人标识。",
  "An image can show the exact configuration, the exact frame platform, the same platform with different components, another color, or another regional build. When the image is not exact, the catalog shows an information marker.": "图片可能展示对应配置、对应车架平台、同平台不同配件、其他颜色或其他地区配置。图片不完全对应时，目录会提供信息标记。",
  "Broken external images are hidden instead of being replaced by a generic bicycle drawing. Use": "失效的外部图片会隐藏，不会用通用自行车示意图替代。可通过",
  "to report a broken link, attribution concern, inaccurate image, removal request, or a better replacement. Do not publish private contact details in an issue.": "报告失效链接、署名疑问、图片不准确、移除请求或更好的替代图片。请勿在公开问题中留下私人联系方式。",
