  "The SSR is Incolor's current radical-aero flagship: a 750 g size-54 claim, integrated seat mast, seven-size geometry and 36C 1× envelope, now tied to a current CNY 23,800 official-store listing.": "SSR 是该记录中的 Incolor 激进气动旗舰：54 码声称 750 g、一体式座桅、七尺码几何及单盘 36C 空间，并对应记录中的 23,800 元官方店铺商品。",
