  "The reviewer says ICAN approached the magazine and supplied wheels, cockpit and the frame for testing; the build otherwise uses parts chosen by the reviewer.": "评测者表示 ICAN 主动联系杂志并提供轮组、车把和车架用于测试；其余零件由评测者自选。",
