  "The creator reviews their own frame bought from Carbonda; the description mentions no sponsorship or supplied product.": "作者评测从 Carbonda 购买的自有车架；简介未提及赞助或厂商提供产品。",
  "Singapore owner interview about a road-leaning CFR696 build on 38 mm tubeless tires at about 28 psi, covering why they chose it, the more aggressive than typical gravel geometry, mounts and use on broken roads.": "新加坡车主访谈：偏公路的 CFR696，38 mm 无内胎外胎约 28 psi，谈选择原因、比一般砾石车更激进的几何、安装点和破损路面使用。",
  "An owner brings their own CFR696 to the creator for an interview; the description promotes channel membership and mentions no brand sponsorship.": "车主带自己的 CFR696 接受作者访谈；简介推广频道会员，未提及品牌赞助。",
