  "The description links ICAN's gravel frameset page; the video does not state how the frameset was obtained.": "简介链接 ICAN 砾石车架页面；视频未说明车架组来源。",
  "Detailed frameset overview: weighed parts, mounts, storage, fork options, warranty, sizing, the owner's manual and thread preparation before the build.": "车架组详细概览：零件称重、安装点、储物、前叉选项、保修、尺码、说明书以及装车前的螺纹处理。",
  "The description carries the creator's Yoeleo discount codes; the video does not state how the frameset was obtained.": "简介含作者的 Yoeleo 折扣码；视频未说明车架组来源。",
