  "Patrick Lino says ICAN sent the frameset; the description lists affiliate and discount codes for several brands.": "Patrick Lino 表示车架组由 ICAN 寄送；简介列出多个品牌的联盟与折扣码。",
  "Finished-build review comparing the G21 with the creator's cheaper Tantan gravel frame on fit, ride over rough pavement and customer experience.": "成车评测：将 G21 与作者较便宜的 Tantan 砾石车架比较合身、粗糙路面骑感和客户体验。",
