  "The creator promotes a Quick Pro USA affiliate code and thanks Quick Pro USA; the video does not state whether the frame was supplied.": "作者推广 Quick Pro USA 联盟码并感谢 Quick Pro USA；视频未说明车架是否为厂商提供。",
