  "Model pages may list brief paraphrases of substantive exact-model opinions from owners, reviewers and test riders on ride, fit, build, weight, compatibility, faults and support. Each links its public source and keeps the configuration, date and any supplied-product or affiliate relationship. Brand and seller material can appear but is never counted. One person or publication counts once per model; repeat comments and syndicated copies are marked and counted once. Each opinion's overall stance is classified as positive, mixed or negative from what its author wrote; no star ratings are invented.": "车型页面可能列出车主、评测者和试骑者针对确切车型的实质意见简述，涉及骑行感受、尺寸合身、装车、重量、兼容性、故障和售后支持。每条意见都链接到公开来源，并保留配置、日期以及任何赠品或联盟推广关系。品牌和卖家内容可以显示，但从不计入。每个人或每家媒体对同一车型只计一次；重复评论和转载副本会被标注并只计一次。每条意见的总体倾向根据作者原话归类为正面、褒贬参半或负面；不会虚构星级评分。",
  "With at least 21 independent opinions on one exact model, the page shows an opinion sentiment summary: the share of positive opinions with mixed ones counted as half, on a 0–100 scale, with its 95% Wilson interval and the number of opinions behind it. It describes sentiment about that model only. It is not a quality score, recommendation or cross-model ranking, and it never feeds sorting, filters or structured data. Below 21 opinions the collection is shown without a summary.": "当同一确切车型拥有至少 21 条独立意见时，页面会显示意见倾向汇总：正面意见所占比例（褒贬参半计为一半），以 0–100 表示，并附 95% Wilson 区间和所依据的意见数量。它只描述对该车型的意见倾向，不是质量评分、推荐或跨车型排名，也从不用于排序、筛选或结构化数据。少于 21 条意见时，只显示意见集合而不显示汇总。",
